      "id": "sentence-00",
      "text": "Emilia is sitting on the sofa."
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-01",
      "text": "She’s looking out the window."
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-02",
      "text": "“I’m so bored!” she thinks."
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-03",
      "text": "It’s her parents’ New Year’s Eve party."
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-04",
      "text": "“How’s second grade?” asks a neighbor."
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-05",
      "text": "“Any mysteries?” asks another."
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-06",
      "text": "Emilia loves detective games."
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-07",
      "text": "She likes reading detective stories, too."
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-08",
      "text": "She wants to be a famous detective!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-09",
      "text": "“Why don’t you try out your new binoculars?” asks Mom."
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-10",
      "text": "“What a great idea!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-11",
      "text": "I have them in my room,” Emilia answers."
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-12",
      "text": "She gets her binoculars and goes outside."
    },
    {
      "id": "sentence-13",
      "text": "She’s very excited."
