      "id": "p41-sentence-00",
      "text": "Emilia is outside looking through the binoculars."
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-sentence-01",
      "text": "Suddenly, she hears a noise!"
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-sentence-02",
      "text": "She’s scared."
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-sentence-03",
      "text": "Then, the garden shed door opens."
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-sentence-04",
      "text": "“Who’s there?” she shouts."
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-sentence-05",
      "text": "Emilia runs into the house."
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-sentence-06",
      "text": "“Dad!” she says."
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-sentence-07",
      "text": "“There’s someone in the yard!”"
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-sentence-08",
      "text": "“Not now, Emilia."
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-sentence-09",
      "text": "It’s almost midnight,” he says."
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-sentence-10",
      "text": "Emilia looks around."
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-sentence-11",
      "text": "Everyone is standing in a circle holding hands."
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-sentence-12",
      "text": "It’s almost midnight."
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-sentence-13",
      "text": "“The new year is coming!"
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-sentence-14",
      "text": "Ten, nine, eight, seven …,” they shout."
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-sentence-15",
      "text": "“Oh, no!"
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-sentence-16",
      "text": "I have to do something,” she thinks."
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-title",
      "text": "Emilia’s New Year’s Adventure. By Kim Milne."
    },
    {
      "id": "p41-think",
