    {
      "id": "p42-sentence-00",
      "text": "Emilia gets her flashlight and runs back into the yard."
    },
    {
      "id": "p42-sentence-01",
      "text": "She turns on the flashlight."
    },
    {
      "id": "p42-sentence-02",
      "text": "There are shoes, garden gloves, and clothes all over."
    },
    {
      "id": "p42-sentence-03",
      "text": "Suddenly, she hears another noise."
    },
    {
      "id": "p42-sentence-04",
      "text": "She shines the flashlight and two red eyes look at her."
    },
    {
      "id": "p42-sentence-05",
      "text": "She turns off her flashlight, runs into the house, and calls the police."
    },
    {
      "id": "p42-sentence-06",
      "text": "Ten minutes later, a police officer knocks on the door."
    },
    {
      "id": "p42-sentence-07",
      "text": "Emilia’s father opens the door."
    },
    {
      "id": "p42-sentence-08",
      "text": "“What’s the problem, sir?” the police officer asks."
    },
    {
      "id": "p42-sentence-09",
      "text": "“Emilia!” calls her father."
    },
    {
      "id": "p43-sentence-10",
      "text": "Emilia takes the police officer to the yard."
    },
    {
      "id": "p43-sentence-11",
      "text": "The guests follow them."
    },
    {
      "id": "p43-sentence-12",
      "text": "“That’s my shoe,” shouts a neighbor."
    },
    {
      "id": "p43-sentence-13",
      "text": "“And those gloves are mine!” says another."
    },
    {
      "id": "p43-sentence-14",
      "text": "The police officer looks at Emilia and says, “People call me every day."
    },
    {
      "id": "p43-sentence-15",
      "text": "They say things disappear from their yards.”"
    },
    {
      "id": "p43-sentence-16",
      "text": "Then, Emilia points at the holes in the yard."
    },
    {
      "id": "p43-sentence-17",
      "text": "“Look at those holes!"
    },
    {
      "id": "p43-sentence-18",
      "text": "The thieves are foxes!” exclaims Emilia."
    },
    {
      "id": "p43-sentence-19",
      "text": "“That’s right,” says the police officer with a smile."
    },
    {
      "id": "p43-sentence-20",
      "text": "Emilia smiles, too."
    },
    {
      "id": "p43-sentence-21",
      "text": "She’s very happy."
    },
    {
      "id": "p43-sentence-22",
      "text": "She helped to solve a real mystery in her own backyard!"
    },
